Subject: [PATCH] Handle missing Kakao Navi provider

Kakao parking integration depends on the Kakao Navi Now Brief provider,
which is not always present on this port. Treat missing login state as
false and make provider-backed parking flows inert instead of registering
observers on an authority that PackageManager cannot resolve.

